# Interface Vision (Boba Tea / Kawaii Theme)

Sidequest Mail should feel like a cozy cafe — but work like Proton Mail.
The pastel colors are the skin, not the mechanics.
Everything below is aesthetic and optional; the core email flow (read, reply, file, delete) must always be instant.

---

## Layout Grid

| Screen       | Boba Concept               | Behavior                                                                 |
|:-------------|:---------------------------|:-------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| **Inbox**    | The Menu Board             | Emails sit like cups on a shelf. Unread emails have a little "fresh" icon. |
|              |                            | Reading one "sips" it — the icon fades slightly.                         |
| **Folders**  | The Shelves                | Each folder is a labeled shelf. Navigating there shows: *"Shelf Restocked!"* |
| **Sent**     | The Takeout Bag            | You sent it out. "Ready for Pickup" energy.                              |
| **Trash**    | The Compost Bin            | Where leftovers go. Dragging an email there drops it gently.             |
|              |                            | Restoring it is "rescuing the cup."                                      |
| **Drafts**   | The Prep Station           | Still being made. Ingredients scattered, half-assembled.                 |

---

## Navigation Grid

| Key          | Action                     | Flavor Text                              |
|:-------------|:---------------------------|:-----------------------------------------|
| **Arrow Keys** | Move focus between emails  | Soft chime or bell sound                 |
| **Spacebar**   | Open selected email        | *"Pouring cup..."*                       |
| **Enter**      | Reply while reading        | *"Sending order."*                       |
| **Drag & Drop** | Move between folders       | Gently placing a cup on a shelf          |

---

## Visual Design Grid

| Element        | Concept                | Description                                                                 |
|:---------------|:-----------------------|:----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| **Sidebar**    | Cafe Decor             | Pastel background with tiny icons (hearts, stars, boba pearls). Fonts are rounded. |
| **Email Cards** | Cups on the Shelf      | Each email is a rounded card with sender's name and subject. Unread cards have a glowing pearl. |
| **Compose**    | The Recipe Card        | A clean, white space with cute borders. Subject line = drink name.           |
| **Stickers**   | Toppings               | Inserting a sticker looks like adding pearls, jelly, or fruit.               |

---

## Micro-interactions Grid

| Action         | Sound / Effect         | Trigger Context                          |
|:---------------|:-----------------------|:-----------------------------------------|
| Reading        | Soft pop               | Like a bubble bursting                   |
| Replying       | Ding                   | Like a bell ringing                      |
| Deleting       | Soft thud              | Like a cup landing on a tray             |
| Searching      | Sparkle                | Like a magical search effect             |
| Composing      | Gentle typing          | Like a soft keyboard click               |
| Loading        | Progress bar           | Fills like a cup being poured            |

> All sounds default to **off**, toggleable in Settings → Audio.
> Silent mode is the default for a reason: this is still an email client people use at work.

